l hypercalcemic pathology", "Mild systolic murmur in left upper sternal border (possible valvular or cardiac involvement)"], "excluded_candidates": ["Acute infectious process: ruled out by normal differential despite leukocytosis", "Stress-induced leukocytosis: less likely given persistent constitutional symptoms and elevated LAP", "Leukemoid reaction: low probability due to normal differential and elevated LAP", "Primary hyperparathyroidism: possible due to elevated calcium but lacks parathyroid hormone data", "Cardiac cause (e.g., valvular disease): less likely given systemic symptoms and lab findings"], "alarm_features": ["Unintentional weight loss", "Systemic constitutional symptoms (fatigue + abdominal pain)", "Leukocytosis with inconclusive source (not reactive or infectious)", "Hypercalcemia (10.9 mEq/L) suggesting neoplastic or endocrine pathology"]}, "branches": {"B1": {"id": "B1", "label": "Chronic Myeloproliferative Neoplasm", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "expanded", "prior": 0.0, "posterior": 0.5238792221084952, "danger": 0.8, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": ["B1.1", "B1.2", "B1.3"], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 2.0, "diagnosis_commitment_gain": 0.7, "interrupt_relevance": 0.6, "level_role": "family", "classification_axis": "management_pathway", "representative_diseases": ["chronic myeloid leukemia", "polycythemia vera", "essential thrombocythemia", "primary myelofibrosis"]}, "B2": {"id": "B2", "label": "Lymphoproliferative / Plasma Cell Disorder", "parent": "ROOT", "level": 1, "status": "live", "prior": 0.19421699078812688, "posterior": 0.19421699078812688, "danger": 0.75, "actionability": 0.0, "explanatory_coverage": 0.0, "expand_score": 0.0, "evidence_for": [], "evidence_against": [], "unresolved_questions": [], "children": [], "closure_reason": "", "turn_cost_to_refine": 1.5, "diagnosis_commitment_gain